  <trk>
    <name>Hollow Rock Trail</name>
    <desc>The Hollow Rock Trail starts with an ascent up stone-cut stairs, then a gravel trail. There are sections of the hike when you have to walk across a rocky area with a cable fence system.

As you progress, the singletrack trail meanders through the woodland. A panorama of the surrounding mountains will greet you at the summit of your ascent. Amazing vistas may be found from several of the trail's viewpoints.</desc>
